          The best gutter sealant is a tripolymer or synthetic rubber sealant made for gutters, applied from inside the trough over bare, clean metal. Silicone bathroom caulk and general-purpose acrylic are the two most common choices for this job, and they are the two most likely to fail by next spring.
        </p>

